      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. it's pretty clear how much it's impacted things. when i'm teaching this to the kids, though, i want to make sure they get the full picture. can you help me write a section that explains why some people or economists argue that these gaps are more about individual choices or general market trends rather than just systemic issues? i want to be able to show them both sides of the debate.",
